      "vulnerability": {
        "@id": "https://ubuntu.com/security/notices/USN-4964-1",
        "name": "USN-4964-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that Exiv2 incorrectly handled certain files. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. This issue only affected Ubuntu 20.04 LTS, Ubuntu 20.10 and Ubuntu 21.04. (CVE-2021-29463)  It was discovered that Exiv2 incorrectly handled certain files. An attacker could possibly use this issue to execute arbitrary code. This issue only affected Ubuntu 20.04 LTS, Ubuntu 20.10 and Ubuntu 21.04. (CVE-2021-29464)  It was discovered that Exiv2 incorrectly handled certain files. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2021-29473, CVE-2021-32617)  It was discovered that Exiv2 incorrectly handled certain files. An attacker could possibly use this issue to expose sensitive information. This issue only affected Ubuntu 20.04 LTS, Ubuntu 20.10 and Ubuntu 21.04. (CVE-2021-29623)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2021-29463",
          "CVE-2021-29464",
